---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="mt-20 border-t border-[--color-rule] bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-8 md:px-6">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between">
      <p class="text-sm text-[--color-ink-soft]">
        © {year} Digital Rulebook ·
        <span class="lang-en-strict">Bilingual reference for EU digital regulations.</span>
        <span class="lang-zh-only">欧盟数字监管法规中英对照。</span>
      </p>
      <p class="text-xs text-[--color-ink-soft]">
        <span class="lang-en-strict">Texts shown for reference only — consult the Official Journal of the European Union for authoritative versions.</span>
        <span class="lang-zh-only">本站文本仅供参考 —— 以《欧盟官方公报》为准。</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
